      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Heard Mr. Uma Shankar Patel, learned counsel for the appellant appearing through virtual High Court at Sundargarh and learned counsel for the State.\nThis is an appeal under section 14-A of S.C. & S.T. (PoA) Act, 1989 in connection with Special G.R.\nCase No.62 of 2021 arising out of Lephripara P.S. Case No.80 of 2021 pending in the Court of learned Special Judge -cum- Additional Sessions Judge, Sundargarh for offences punishable under sections 376(2)(n)/380/313 of the Indian Penal Code read with section 3(2)(v) of the S.C. & S.T.\n(PoA) Act.\nLearned counsel for the appellant submits that the case // 2 // is now posted in the learned trial Court for recording of evidence of the defence witnesses.\nIn view of the stage of the trial, I am not inclined to release the appellant on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
